      "message": "fix(agentd): fence desktop succession with original issuer and writer\n\nThe unmodified four-package native run passed 812 of 813 tests. The existing\ndesktop successor test showed replacement still succeeded after revoking the\noriginal issuer, because the mutation held only the current writer lease.\n\nAdopt exactly the three source blobs from 65f0ad816ffa4724626db3f1c36a20eb7faab61f.\nBoth original leases now enter the existing same-owner joint boundary, with\ncurrent revision/revocation checks and issuer/writer epoch/time checks around\nthe durable policy CAS. Retain the current writer proof and policy CAS checks.\n\nDonor-parent and candidate base blobs, including the original failing test,\nmatch exactly. No test, signer requirement, budget, profile or workflow changes.\nNative confirmation of this repair remains required.\n\nSigned-off-by: Franksudoman <sunfocapital@gmail.com>\n(cherry picked from commit facba0d32c1cd0e8163a6186d7ba91fa311f2e2e)"
    },
